PURPOSE:
Form to create an internal employee account with department
and role(s).

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Admin

ROUTE: /Admin/Users/Create

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Add [HttpPost, ValidateAntiForgeryToken] Create with
  server-side validation.
- Create the user with UserManager and set FullName,
  DepartmentId and IsActive.
- Assign roles with UserManager.AddToRoleAsync using the
  SystemRoles names.
- Write an AuditLog entry without the password.

